OL,3,AMore cells being built within prisons
OL,4,Ato help tackle overcrowding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is spending #110m on
OL,7,Fcreating more cells in existing prisons
OL,8,Fin England and Wales as part of its
OL,9,Fplans to tackle overcrowding.
OL,11,FThe money, which has been "fast-tracked
OL,12,Ffrom existing budgets", will be used to
OL,13,Fconvert existing space within prisons,
OL,14,Fsuch as unused office space, laundry
OL,15,Frooms and storage space into cells the
OL,16,FMinistry of Justice said.
OL,18,FThe government has been under pressure
OL,19,Fover an early release scheme for
OL,20,Fprisoners to free up space as prisons
OL,21,Fnear maximum capacity.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
