OL,3,AMore cells being built within prisons
OL,4,Ato help tackle overcrowding
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris told the
OL,7,FBBC he could assure people that
OL,8,Fperpetrators being released early "does
OL,9,Fnot mean freedom", adding that victims
OL,10,Fwill have a say in restrictions placed
OL,11,Fon criminals, adding he wanted "victims
OL,12,Fto live their lives as fully as
OL,13,Fpossible".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
